---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, LEGAL_NAME } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Phronimos"
  description="How Phronimos collects, uses, and protects the information you share with us."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="muted">Effective July 7, 2026</p>

        <p>
          This site is operated by {LEGAL_NAME} ("Phronimos", "we"). This policy describes what we
          collect through phronimos.io and how we use it.
        </p>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Contact inquiries.</strong> When you submit the contact form, we receive the
            name, email, company, and message you provide.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Assessment responses.</strong> When you complete the AI maturity assessment, we
            receive your answers and the contact details you provide with them.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Basic technical data.</strong> Our hosting provider records standard server
            logs, such as IP address and pages requested, for security and reliability.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not run advertising trackers, and we do not sell personal information.</p>

        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <p>
          We use what you share to respond to your inquiry, prepare assessment results, and, where
          you have asked us to, follow up about our services. We keep correspondence for as long as
          it is useful to the relationship.
        </p>

        <h2>Who processes it</h2>
        <p>
          Form submissions are delivered to us by Web3Forms, and the site is served by our hosting
          provider. Both act as processors on our behalf. Client engagements are governed by their
          own agreements, including data-processing terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask us to correct or delete information you have shared at any time by writing to
          <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          If this policy changes, the new version will be posted here with an updated effective
          date.
        </p>

        <p>
          Questions: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
